Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Make legal pages and the homepage readable without
 JavaScript.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

WebPrüfer only saw the empty app shell, so Impressum, privacy policy and terms looked missing, Google Fonts were loaded from Google, and the cookie banner had no reject button. Serve those pages as real HTML, drop the external fonts, and add the security and SEO files the check looks for.
